    "statement": "The claim that every official admissible F2 antipodal window splits into at most four F_p-proportionality classes is false. For the Mersenne prime p=2^61-1 and q=p^2, q<2^256 and ord_(2^41)(p)=2=e, but gcd(2^41,p-1)=2, so the antipodal half-system has 2^40 singleton classes. The corrected p=1 mod 4 reduction survives.",
